# The context is what the Dockerfile COPYs and nothing else - same rule as discord-bot's, and the
# same trap: a new COPY without a line here fails the build with `failed to compute cache key`.
*
!build/libs/*.jar
!build/compose/compose.yml

# The thin jar back out again: shadowJar leaves both side by side and the COPY uses a glob. Two
# matches is not an error - BuildKit picks one and says nothing - so this line is what guarantees
# the fat jar is the one that lands.
build/libs/*-thin.jar
